'''Thanks for All''' (感謝御礼, ''Kansha Orei'', '''Gratitude and Thanks''') is a 1-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 6.1 Update|Version 6.1]].

==Effect==
Accounting Power UP (Sm): Money gained when defeating an enemy increases by 10%.

